21031      data survey;
21032      call streaminit(722);
21033      do stratum=1 to 2;
21034      do cluster=1 to 4;
21035      do id=1 to 12;
21036      age=20+mod(id*7+cluster,45);
21037      event=rand('bernoulli',0.3);
21038      weight=2+stratum+cluster/10;
21039      output;
21040      end;
21041      end;
21042      end;
21043      run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.SURVEY has 96 observations and 6 variables.

21044      proc surveylogistic data=survey;
21045      strata stratum;
21046      cluster cluster;
21047      weight weight;
21048      model event(event='1')=age;
21049      run;

NOTE: PROC SURVEYLOGISTIC is modeling the probability that event=1.
NOTE: Convergence criterion (GCONV=1E-8) satisfied.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE SURVEYLOGISTIC printed page 1416.

